# Roundhouse ACL for Mosquitto.
#
# Every device logs in to the broker with its device ID as the user name.
# Home Assistant logs in as its own user. Roundhouse cannot check this file: it
# is what stops one device from writing another device's topics.

# Home Assistant: everything under roundhouse/, and its own status topic.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
topic readwrite roundhouse/#

# A device (%u is the user name, which is the device ID): it publishes its own
# announce, availability, status, and commands, and reads what Roundhouse
# publishes for it.
pattern write roundhouse/%u/announce
pattern write roundhouse/%u/availability
pattern write roundhouse/%u/status
pattern write roundhouse/%u/cmd
pattern read roundhouse/%u/meta
pattern read roundhouse/%u/views
pattern read roundhouse/%u/state/#
pattern read roundhouse/%u/icon/#
pattern read roundhouse/%u/alert/#
pattern read roundhouse/%u/result
pattern read homeassistant/status
